{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Through the Nest</strong> is a fast-paced top-down sci-fi roguelite shooter that throws you into deadly alien hives.<br>Each hive you clear leads to another filled with tougher, more dangerous enemies. Every run challenges you with new surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Class System</strong>: Begin with 2 playable classes. Earn <i>chips</i> through gameplay to unlock new ones and experiment with different playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddec <strong>Roguelite Loop</strong>: Play, earn <i>chips</i>, die, grow, and try again. Permanent progression ensures that every run brings you closer to strength.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Run-Based Upgrades</strong>: Level up and choose powerful upgrades. Every decision shapes your strategy and makes each run unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7e <strong>Challenging Hive System</strong>: Clearing one hive pushes you into the next, where deadlier enemies and fiercer battles await.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3733950?t=1764093670","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3733950?t=1764093670","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733950/ad787b4fd2a380945303693b2872c2ad662a2a90/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764093670","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733950/ad787b4fd2a380945303693b2872c2ad662a2a90/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764093670","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"The game does not contain any sexual content.\r\nHowever, during gameplay players use firearms and various abilities to fight and eliminate non-realistic creatures. The violence is purely fictional and directed only at imaginary enemies. There is no depiction of violence against humans, animals, or other realistic elements that might be considered sensitive."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Through the Nest</strong> is a fast-paced top-down sci-fi roguelite shooter that throws you into deadly alien hives.<br>Each hive you clear leads to another filled with tougher, more dangerous enemies. Every run challenges you with new surprises.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2694\ufe0f <strong>Class System</strong>: Begin with 2 playable classes. Earn <i>chips</i> through gameplay to unlock new ones and experiment with different playstyles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\uddec <strong>Roguelite Loop</strong>: Play, earn <i>chips</i>, die, grow, and try again. Permanent progression ensures that every run brings you closer to strength.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udcc8 <strong>Run-Based Upgrades</strong>: Level up and choose powerful upgrades. Every decision shapes your strategy and makes each run unique.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7e <strong>Challenging Hive System</strong>: Clearing one hive pushes you into the next, where deadlier enemies and fiercer battles await.</p></li></ul>","developers":["Urdina Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3733950/6dbfdf6e5dbe831c0d17095167f34f8ddcd19b5f/header.jpg?t=1764093670","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_